{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "d1fed59cbce24a007273b843e909c257423093ce7b40fb27c9ecd7341416ae7b", "ja": "優しさと、正しさと", "zh": "温柔与正确", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dfb2f5fe5d0b12b7909df7f46af99ffa8398590066f2938b609fba8335e62d8a", "ja": "女の子は、自分の花の成長が遅れている事を\n悲しんでいた。何日か経っても、状況は変わ\nらない。風花は「きっと咲く」と励ますが、\n桃子は「守れるかわからない約束はしない方\nがいい」と、強く否定するのだった。", "zh": "小女孩因为自己的花长得比别人慢而感到\n难过。即便过了好几天，情况也没有任何改变。\n风花鼓励她说“一定会开花的”，但桃子却\n强烈反对，认为“不知道能不能遵守的约定，\n还是不要许下比较好”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cd96be41dc7817cd04d75255e7c3cef094772ceb1b93caae77cd71f64ce2d460", "ja": "（花の様子を見に来たガーデニング教室で、\n美也が、女の子が佇んでいるのに気づいた）", "zh": "（在前来查看花朵情况的园艺教室里，美也注意到那个女孩正站在那里）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "85231ec4b86af81237524269227fd86c5ff7df85e86a47bb11c8578962ea49db", "ja": "（様子が気になるので、風花と一緒に\n声を掛けに行ったのだが……）", "zh": "（因为有些在意她的情况，所以和风花一起过去搭话，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "2cb1e5e751e1c03754074272f736b48df11657df68e76e86e7b0cd69cbd93a42", "ja": "こんにちは、ちょっといいですか～？\n悲しい顔をして、どうかしましたか～？", "zh": "你好，可以打扰一下吗～？\n你看起来一脸难过，是怎么了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1003_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "c8b2416108dfcec241794ad1180214659b0920d0d63096b91f59e0c4ab5eee84", "ja": "あ、えっと……。\nあのね、わたしのお花さん、元気がないの……。", "zh": "啊，那个……  \n那个，我的花儿……没什么精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "47e3d8f0426649cdfc0d6e7aea6efcb96e734002aa84656f4c3715f8a8297cc8", "ja": "どれどれ～……むむっ。本当ですな～。\n他の花より、すこし小さい気もしますね……。", "zh": "让我看看～……唔唔，确实如此呢～。\n感觉比其他花朵稍微小了一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ca7e042535fa2854ef063228c87af9b8396ac817fca68594066a8dbfae509cdf", "ja": "もしかしたら、のんびり屋さんなのかも……？\nきちんとお世話をすれば、元気になると思うよ。", "zh": "说不定它只是个慢性子……？\n只要好好照顾，我想它就会打起精神来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1006_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "5e3c3454bf2d698ae09fdb502e85f2c495e3e6d1e7f8107ee1d0bf635bd46855", "ja": "……ほんとに？", "zh": "……真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6a3c4912cd5c29ba460061af45ffaf82af538beb27daf934bf2c6183fab9b772", "ja": "うん！　だから、お花さんを信じて、\n待っててあげよう？", "zh": "嗯！所以，要相信花朵，等着它吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1008_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "780675574a5d64fb5df9dff646f57765c563d37d30a0196f196a53593934bba4", "ja": "う、うん！　わかった……えへへ。", "zh": "嗯、嗯！知道了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1009_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "cc4b2b643d20e3443bcd1e6d5a104fbcad70cb8e3bb8135958dd2faa972053de", "ja": "むーん……状況は変わりませんね～。\n肥料もお水もきちんとあげてるのに、不思議ですな～。", "zh": "唔——……情况还是没有变呢～。\n肥料和水明明都有好好地给，真是不可思议呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "0d3dc090a009ff1f76498c49b61ccccfc6fe6a1ede7bdeff8b1bbf0271ab4bf6", "ja": "ひなたさんにも聞いてみましたが、\n何もしないで見守るのも大事なことだと……。", "zh": "我也问过日向了，她说什么都不做、静静守望也是很重要的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "7374c53478b0c00109ee6d4c38e0cb4e5458f5a429a0dfd44aa91056298c6c93", "ja": "教室の先生も、同じことを言ってたわ。\nよくあることだから、見守ってあげて、って。", "zh": "辅导班的老师也说过一样的话呢。\n说是常有的事，在旁静静守望就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "a8c4b1d8e53f7e4bb8eb108f986509d7acda5ce03ce029e12a1178986a01195b", "ja": "何もしないで、見てるだけなの？\nでも、それじゃ……。", "zh": "什么都不做，只是在旁边看着吗？\n可是，那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "33c13bf8692d239cdb9aa5e04bc99864ad89c69a51475969f54aa6f7e7a624cc", "ja": "そうだな。もどかしいけど……手を掛けすぎる事で、\n逆に上手くいかない事もあるみたいなんだ。", "zh": "是啊。虽然让人着急……但有时候，插手太多反而会弄巧成拙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1016_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "d9d4bb4e8a1ae7add747e6457a683b9318a4d6da4877cd42a09395a552821f77", "ja": "お花さん、だいじょうぶかな……ぐすっ。", "zh": "小花，没事吧……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b0df791497771a3e4d884218fb88eb50cad35a6eab1f8389922890283164312a", "ja": "不安だよね……。\nでも、きっと大丈夫だよ！", "zh": "你很不安吧……\n不过，一定没事的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0cfb1419ba2965beaae84bd014c6bfbb684dcac9837ee48666f6b0963b4361be", "ja": "みんなで「元気になーれ」って、\n願いを込めてお世話をすれば、きっと……。", "zh": "只要大家一起倾注心愿，\n念着“快快打起精神来～”好好照料它的话，一定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a6e7bb42783249afea96b919ea8b7d5b5465df8d1d976d16a58418e97b2a73a2", "ja": "お花さん、咲いてくれるんじゃないかな？\nだから、もう少しだけお姉さん達と頑張ってみよう！", "zh": "花儿们，说不定会为我们绽放呢？\n所以，再和姐姐们一起努力一会儿吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1021_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "084f8ef77f88db706332a0832ece973406d0765543c545e464ae0708bfd33888", "ja": "……うん！　がんばってみる！", "zh": "……嗯！我会努力试试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "5f78428362fbd01af18b582974317caf0d75b1572a67334d733e3152b5733554", "ja": "あの子、別れる時は笑顔だったけど……。\nお花、ちょっと心配ね。", "zh": "那个孩子，告别的时候虽然挂着笑脸……\n但花朵的情况，还是有点让人担心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "551889c9139aaa164a002cb5922210ec0437bcb2d2678952d9f7a6edd020cdec", "ja": "はい。試せる事は全て試してみたので、後は\n先生やひなたの言うとおり、見守るだけかと。", "zh": "是的。能试的办法我都试过了，接下来就像老师和日向说的那样，只要守望着就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7ffe35647ca5b58a3790687d7ac8d3280e5c96276ffd3615b96b36a781a86d6b", "ja": "あの子、すごく熱心にお世話してたから……。\n私も、できる限りお手伝いしてあげたくて。", "zh": "那个孩子一直照顾得那么用心……\n我也想尽己所能帮帮她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "1a43855ead6e8d533317be67720f8c774f1c7bf0276b7a78ed7c9f44ef4365bd", "ja": "ええ、そうね。大人としても、アイドルとしても、\n小さな子のガッカリした顔なんて、見たくないもの。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。不管是作为大人，还是作为偶像，都不想看到小孩子失望的表情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "4eec5542058796bc631fa6b95f7ab6503825446fb62841fb5e2e6177bb2e2c8f", "ja": "……。でも……お世話したって、\n全部の花が、ちゃんと咲くわけじゃないよね？", "zh": "……。但是……就算好好照顾了，\n也不是所有的花都会顺利开花的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "a9e8a379e835b3e2fc17d2f46720c7a784083612422d28cbb0acd844116bf4cc", "ja": "……桃子？", "zh": "……桃子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "1b6c08cd76cc9dd3c0a02673e2158b266371bca1fd201f045fc7c2df75432b9e", "ja": "学校でお花のお世話した時も。\nたくさん咲いたけど、全部は咲かなかった……。", "zh": "在学校照顾花的时候也是这样。\n虽然开了很多，但并没有全部盛开……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "eed53217c46d3fd971e37aeba0e8ecda11a11bd0dcd9bb2b292b0b254b9e045c", "ja": "咲く前に枯れちゃったり、芽が出ないお花もあって……\nだからもしかしたら、あの子のお花も……。", "zh": "有的花在开花前就枯掉了，有的甚至都没发芽……\n所以说不定，那个孩子的花也会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4", "ja": "それは……。", "zh": "你的意思是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "fcafe22817893f6739d15a7ee8e95ac0303eeb0013b820946dd833e0c440a34e", "ja": "風花さん、あの子に咲くって言ったけど……\n絶対咲くかどうかなんて、そんなのわからないよ。", "zh": "风花姐，你对那孩子说它会开花，可是……\n谁也不知道它到底会不会开花啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "9c029554b188630416247f53eaa7e9e31b11273d39a30fd4353c04fea252de38", "ja": "守れるかどうかわからない約束なら、\n最初からしない方がいいと思う。", "zh": "要是不知道能不能遵守约定，\n桃子觉得从一开始就最好不要答应。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1035_041fuk", "source_sha256": "82b42bcd2ef29a2dca415171ba6346794b70668c73ae701079ecdf00d0404839", "ja": "桃子ちゃん……。", "zh": "桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1037_049mom", "source_sha256": "f44e271e182a8194dad25ef10e46c6dfc99ebb4c9bfed93db96ce2798267d080", "ja": "お兄ちゃん……。\n……桃子、先に帰るね。", "zh": "哥哥……\n……桃子先回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1038_p", "source_sha256": "cd8b412e984c540909e0a77822ae2ff2f8b90a2163edb7c8fe6103236a59ff44", "ja": "あっ、桃子！", "zh": "啊，桃子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1039_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a74c2335ea321a77bb0425dca6c11708f5e34b6577b45211511472ca2796ded0", "ja": "桃子ちゃん！", "zh": "小桃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1040_042miy", "source_sha256": "97e8134253262844e23e669b6e03456d8d291c7a147e90f5ff6228ce623cb175", "ja": "{$P$}さん、私が行きます～\n何かあったら、連絡しますね～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我去看看吧～\n有什么事的话，我会跟您联络的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1041_032emi", "source_sha256": "5b627db3417ea872da86b2aafa7d809d256ada027d90ac305a37740eacaa0942", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、私もここで失礼いたします。\n美也さん、一緒に……！", "zh": "制作人先生，我也先告辞了。\n美也，我们一起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "47003a1afca600ef4e0755423f2527e28136c26d3fb7c31433ef7d685c90cb16", "ja": "あ、ああ……わかった！\nすまないが、よろしく頼むな。", "zh": "啊，啊啊……知道了！\n不好意思，那就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1043_039kon", "source_sha256": "7bd8ff3394c6fcc918b60ab36f0c59397841715bc3073c6492d30394bddbdaed", "ja": "風花ちゃん……大丈夫？", "zh": "风花……没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1044_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6cadc257da3dcb8d44785eccee3fa66c5a412ba62605741425d10c55a20c723e", "ja": "このみさん、{$P$}さん、\nすみません……私……。", "zh": "可奈小姐，{$P$}先生，\n对不起……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1045_039kon", "source_sha256": "0d74c766598e1fcefac5de3bc22dbe4c176efaad6ac8bd0648f464a5fd669586", "ja": "いいのよ、風花ちゃん。\nそれに風花ちゃんは、悪くないわ。", "zh": "没关系，风花。\n而且风花也没有做错什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1046_039kon", "source_sha256": "b4e784b69f4daaaeaec3937566d3491b2c9b5d2e5a8b3c7ab54afeb2a53fbade", "ja": "もちろん、桃子ちゃんもね。", "zh": "当然，桃子也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1047_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8e3bf244b4644c436508aa078c0a02e072b8fbbe42716c90b952ec9a4484f88e", "ja": "このみさん……。", "zh": "木实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1048_039kon", "source_sha256": "c13502661b2c906d804e37a5d039648aca08007ce7975e9d1aa54ec74c417487", "ja": "{$P$}。いったん美也ちゃんと\nエミリーちゃんに任せて、私たちも戻りましょうか。", "zh": "{$P$}。先暂时交给美也和艾米莉，我们也回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1049_039kon", "source_sha256": "edcb883fa00896a37ef608973b1953db6fb275db9dccceb982f73aecc2bd2057", "ja": "お花もだけど……見守ることしかできないって、\nなんだかもどかしいわね。", "zh": "虽然花也是……可除了守望以外什么都做不了，总觉得有些令人焦急呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_03_1050_p", "source_sha256": "e8ead3adf43e0224f20355e170d3e0e53077041e2b9670894e51f05de8a62fb2", "ja": "（このみさんの言うとおりだ。\nでもこれは、確かに……もどかしい気分だな）", "zh": "（正如琴美所说的。不过，这确实……让人觉得有些焦躁啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
